    <title>
        add MCP server, LLM eval harness, and CI
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-10T02:39:34Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76237763?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Dilnazzzz</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Dilnazzzz</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;add MCP server, LLM eval harness, and CI

- mcp/server.mjs: Model Context Protocol server exposing the curriculum, word bank, progress, and reading-coverage analysis as tools for any MCP client (5 tools, read-only, stdio)
- evals/: pedagogy eval harness for the tutor&amp;#39;s structured output — pure invariant assertions, a live runner (evals/run.ts) that scores the shipped model, and CI-safe fixture tests proving the assertions catch violations
- .github/workflows/ci.yml: tests + build on every push
- README: MCP + evals sections, CI badge&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
